# Build context exclusions for the root Dockerfile.
#
# Before this file existed, every build shipped the full ~908MB working tree as context, even
# though the Dockerfile only consumes three paths: `pom.xml`, `src/`, and `.git/`. Worse,
# `src/frontend/node_modules` lives INSIDE `src/`, so `COPY src/ src/` dragged 397MB of
# host-installed dependencies into the builder image — including native modules compiled for the
# host OS/arch, which are wrong inside a linux/amd64 container. frontend-maven-plugin installs
# its own node and runs its own `npm ci` in the builder, so the host copy was never needed and
# only risked shadowing the correct one. Same host/arch-shadowing class for `src/frontend/node/`
# (frontend-maven-plugin's own locally-downloaded node distribution, incl. a host-arch `node`
# binary) and `src/frontend/coverage/` (generated Vitest output) — neither is matched by
# `**/node_modules/` and both were found still shipping into the context (skillars-deferred-142
# code review, 2026-10-05).
#
# DO NOT add `.git` here. The Dockerfile copies it deliberately: git-commit-id-maven-plugin
# (pom.xml) reads it during `mvn package` to stamp build/commit metadata. Excluding it breaks
# the build. At ~30MB it is a small part of the context anyway.
#
# Everything below is either build output, host-only tooling, documentation, or secrets — none
# of it is read by the Dockerfile.

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
src/frontend/node_modules/
src/frontend/dist/
src/frontend/.quasar/
src/frontend/node/
src/frontend/coverage/
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/*.jar
**/*.war

# ── Secrets. These must never enter a build context or an image layer ────────
# .env.local carries POSTGRES_PASSWORD and local S3 credentials; the uat/prod files carry more.
# The Dockerfile never reads them (compose supplies env at RUN time via --env-file), so shipping
# them into the context was pure exposure.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Docs, planning artifacts and agent tooling (host-only) ───────────────────
docs/
requirements/
_bmad/
_bmad-output/
.claude/
.agent/
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# ── Compose / deploy / CI definitions. Read by the host, not by the image ────
docker-compose*.yml
deploy/
.github/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# ── Maven wrapper: the builder stage uses the maven base image's own `mvn` ───
mvnw
mvnw.cmd

# ── Editor / OS / VCS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
**/*.iml
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── Stray local scratch files ────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
**/*.diff
diff.txt
